ath "2"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13965088/state.json" "file_sha256" "3fffea451a819647cab98429e526789880fb1f7c85cb6c6904836215f7a554e2" "basis" 656 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13965088/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-237016" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "1"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13965088/state.json" "file_sha256" "3fffea451a819647cab98429e526789880fb1f7c85cb6c6904836215f7a554e2" "basis" 656 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13965088/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-19139" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Let $a=⟨3,2,1⟩$ and $b=⟨3,4,1⟩.$ Find the scalar projection of $a$ onto $b.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14003439/state.json" "file_sha256" "e178efe0503452c947df6835b908700d28bbbbe708604a9d6ea25edf5e2cbf29" "basis" 1085 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14003439/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-19139" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Using the formula for the scalar projection, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\text{comp}}_{b}\\,a & =\\frac{a\\cdot b}{|\\,b\\,|} \\\\  & =\\frac{{a}_{x}{b}_{x}+{a}_{y}{b}_{y}+{a}_{z}{b}_{z}}{\\sqrt{{b}_{x}^{2}+{b}_{y}^{2}+{b}_{z}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{3\\cdot 3+2\\cdot 4+1\\cdot 1}{\\sqrt{{3}^{2}+{4}^{2}+{1}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{18}{\\sqrt{26}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14003439/state.json" "file_sha256" "e178efe0503452c947df6835b908700d28bbbbe708604a9d6ea25edf5e2cbf29" 